### ==================== ERROR CASES ====================

### Test 12: Create Order - Free Shipping with Exceeding Weight (Should Fail)
POST http://localhost:8081/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "C8",
  "weight": 6,
  "shippingType": "FREE",
  "destination": "Spain"
}

### Test 13: Bind Vehicle to Non-existent Order (Should Fail)
POST http://localhost:8081/vehicles/bindVehicleToOrder
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "VAN",
  "orderId": 999
}

