### ==================== NOTES ====================
# Shipping Types:
# - STANDARD: weight × 2.5 (most economical)
# - EXPRESS: (weight × 2.5) × 1.5 (premium, 50% markup)
# - FREE: 0.0 (max 5kg only)
#
# Vehicle Types:
# - TRUCK: Large capacity, bulk deliveries
# - VAN: Medium capacity, standard deliveries
# - DRONE: Fast delivery, light packages
#
# Order Status Lifecycle:
# - PENDING: Order created, awaiting processing
# - DELAYED: Vehicle in service
# - READY: Ready for delivery
# - FAILED: Processing failed
#
# Expected Response Codes:
# - 202 ACCEPTED: Order created successfully
# - 200 OK: Vehicle bound successfully, Analytics retrieved
# - 400 BAD REQUEST: Invalid input
# - 404 NOT FOUND: Resource not found
# - 500 INTERNAL SERVER ERROR: Server error
